flowchart LR
 accTitle: Tool Taxonomy  Sensors vs Executors (Theoretical Contribution)
 classDef think fill:#1a0d2b,stroke:#7b2fff,stroke-width:3px,color:#c084fc
 classDef sensor  fill:#0d1a2b,stroke:#00aaff,stroke-width:3px,color:#60c8ff
 classDef exec fill:#2b0d1a,stroke:#ff2d78,stroke-width:3px,color:#ff8fab
 classDef store fill:#0d2b1a,stroke:#00ff88,stroke-width:2px,color:#00ff88
 classDef world fill:#2b1a00,stroke:#ffe600,stroke-width:2px,color:#ffe600
 classDef note fill:#0a0e1a,stroke:#444,stroke-width:1px,color:#888,font-style:italic

 T["THINK<br/>LLM selects next tool<br/>based on current state"]:::think

 T -->|observe| TS["Sensors - read-only<br/>screenshot / read_page / process_list<br/>clipboard_read / find_window / locate_on_screen"]:::sensor

 T -->|execute| TE["Executors<br/>side-effects / run_command / write_file<br/>launch_app / click / type_text<br/>press_key / navigate"]:::exec

 TS -->|append result| ED["Evidence Dict<br/>append-only / read by THINK<br/>each step"]:::store

 TE -->|modifies| WS["World State<br/>filesystem / UI / browser"]:::world

 ED -->|feeds next THINK| T

 WS -->|next STAO step:<br/>Sensors re-observe| NOTE(["changed<br/>World State<br/>-> new Sensor output<br/>-> new Evidence"]):::note
